.TH CLOG_CLEAR_FIELDS 3 "2026-07-10" "c_collections" "C Collections Library - Functions"
.SH NAME
clog_clear_fields \- remove all attached structured fields
.SH LIBRARY
C Collections (libccollections, \-lccollections)
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
#include <ccollections/clogger.h>

void clog_clear_fields(clog logger);
.fi
.SH DESCRIPTION
.nf
Removes and frees every field that the logger holds.  A later log line
then carries no key=value pair between func= and msg=.
.fi
.SH PARAMETERS
.nf
logger  Logger handle.
.fi
.SH NOTES
.nf
Thread-safe.  The mutex of the logger protects it.
Asserts when logger is CLOG_INVALID, stale or already closed.
.fi
.SH "SEE ALSO"
.BR clog_set_field (3),
.BR clog_remove_field (3)
